[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-OCD002
TITLE: The pilot speaks FAA phraseology through a link whose method is not chosen
STATEMENT: >>>
The pilot shall exchange the local-pattern requests, reports, and readbacks with the tower by FAA phraseology. The concept shall name the AIM and JO 7110.65 as the authority for the order of that speech and shall leave the radio, socket, or other carrying method unselected. Acceptance is a concept in which every operational exchange can be read as a phrase while no wire format is required to understand it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The words are the operational interface. The carriage can be chosen later.
<<<
DAL: E
